# Midnight-Skills (required)

For any Midnight Network, Compact, wallet, ZK, or privacy-boundary work:

1. Read `.agents/skills/midnightskill/SKILL.md` first (router).
2. Then read only the matching skill under `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (also mirrored in `.cursor/skills/`).

| Task | Skills |
|------|--------|
| Wallet connect / 1AM | `react-wallet-connector`, `1am-wallet` |
| SDK / adapters / txs | `midnight-js`, `midnight-transactions` |
| Compact / contracts docs | `compact` |
| Privacy / medical leaks | `midnight-security`, `why-midnight` |
| Tests | `testing` |
| Env / proof server | `midnight-environment-setup` |

Constraints: do not invent Compact syntax, generated bindings, or 1am APIs. `MidnightAdapter` throws until connected; demo path only with `NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_DEMO_MIDNIGHT=true`.
